    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/9cec22153d189d58906100f9241af159.avif?t=1743443944\" /></span>Venture on a journey of evolution with a cunning reptilian hunter carrying a Tesseract, an ancient artifact from beyond recorded history. Evolve by slaying enemies and undertake a seemingly impossible task of preventing catastrophe that threatens all life, and attempt to discover its origin.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/218a15aac31e71b93bae61ce37a53cf7.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/218a15aac31e71b93bae61ce37a53cf7.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/218a15aac31e71b93bae61ce37a53cf7.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to gain temporary environmental abilities and get ahead of your enemies. Adapt before combat to prepare a strong opener or during combat to extend your combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/53c4a6141eea935757bb7edf48e372fe.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/53c4a6141eea935757bb7edf48e372fe.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/53c4a6141eea935757bb7edf48e372fe.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expose enemy weaknesses and wait for the opening to strike enemies where it hurts,  dealing massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7c3b14ef69b59a63956611ae89d5a6d2.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7c3b14ef69b59a63956611ae89d5a6d2.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7c3b14ef69b59a63956611ae89d5a6d2.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different weapons and utilize a vast array of tools, traps, and combat moves at your disposal to ensure your spot at the top of the food chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7837cccca96674bdf3e85469b879cae2.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7837cccca96674bdf3e85469b879cae2.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7837cccca96674bdf3e85469b879cae2.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/beec0b78fac05b069dc3f09aebb38a25.avif?t=1743443944\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat utilizing different weapons such as spear, bow or daggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt and get temporary abilities that give you advantage in combat as well as exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast interconnected prehistoric world inhabited by dinosaurs and reptiles in diverse stages of evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet intriguing characters and experience their stories through quest-lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire materials through professions and engage in transmutation to craft items, upgrades, and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your play-style to defeat any enemy with a highly customizable load-out system, combining equip-able combat abilities, switching weapons and utilizing diverse passive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undergo evolution by mastering an array of skills and abilities. Augment your agility through different movement techniques and bolster your strength by consuming samples of fallen beings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon death, gain insight into the Spirit Realm\u2014a plane positioned between life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an intricately designed, hand-painted prehistoric world characterized by vibrant aesthetics and a cryptic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the history of reptilian and dinosaur tribes that dominate the planet, and unravel the enigmatic secrets that shaped their very existence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich orchestral soundtrack that echoes the primitive yet cryptic and otherworldly nature of the primordial planet.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/9cec22153d189d58906100f9241af159.avif?t=1743443944\" /></span>Venture on a journey of evolution with a cunning reptilian hunter carrying a Tesseract, an ancient artifact from beyond recorded history. Evolve by slaying enemies and undertake a seemingly impossible task of preventing catastrophe that threatens all life, and attempt to discover its origin.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/218a15aac31e71b93bae61ce37a53cf7.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/218a15aac31e71b93bae61ce37a53cf7.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/218a15aac31e71b93bae61ce37a53cf7.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to gain temporary environmental abilities and get ahead of your enemies. Adapt before combat to prepare a strong opener or during combat to extend your combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/53c4a6141eea935757bb7edf48e372fe.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/53c4a6141eea935757bb7edf48e372fe.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/53c4a6141eea935757bb7edf48e372fe.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expose enemy weaknesses and wait for the opening to strike enemies where it hurts,  dealing massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7c3b14ef69b59a63956611ae89d5a6d2.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7c3b14ef69b59a63956611ae89d5a6d2.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7c3b14ef69b59a63956611ae89d5a6d2.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different weapons and utilize a vast array of tools, traps, and combat moves at your disposal to ensure your spot at the top of the food chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7837cccca96674bdf3e85469b879cae2.poster.avif?t=1743443944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7837cccca96674bdf3e85469b879cae2.webm?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/7837cccca96674bdf3e85469b879cae2.mp4?t=1743443944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521660/extras/beec0b78fac05b069dc3f09aebb38a25.avif?t=1743443944\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat utilizing different weapons such as spear, bow or daggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt and get temporary abilities that give you advantage in combat as well as exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast interconnected prehistoric world inhabited by dinosaurs and reptiles in diverse stages of evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet intriguing characters and experience their stories through quest-lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire materials through professions and engage in transmutation to craft items, upgrades, and tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your play-style to defeat any enemy with a highly customizable load-out system, combining equip-able combat abilities, switching weapons and utilizing diverse passive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undergo evolution by mastering an array of skills and abilities. Augment your agility through different movement techniques and bolster your strength by consuming samples of fallen beings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon death, gain insight into the Spirit Realm\u2014a plane positioned between life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into an intricately designed, hand-painted prehistoric world characterized by vibrant aesthetics and a cryptic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the history of reptilian and dinosaur tribes that dominate the planet, and unravel the enigmatic secrets that shaped their very existence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rich orchestral soundtrack that echoes the primitive yet cryptic and otherworldly nature of the primordial planet.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An extinction-level threat looms over a prehistoric world of tribal reptiles and dinosaurs. Adapt, evolve, and outmaneuver savage enemies and seek to prevent the prophesied end of a hand painted jurassic world.",
